# MetaLens environment variables
#
# MetaLens does not require any environment variables to run.
# This file is provided as a template for future configuration.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in values if/when needed:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# Example (optional) — a custom User-Agent override for the fetcher:
# METALENS_USER_AGENT="MetaLens/1.0 (+https://your-domain.com; SEO analysis bot)"